                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 4.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Form to the Russian Government.</hi>
                </head>
                <p>On October 28, your excellency, together with the Japanese Chargé d’Affaires and
                    the British Minister, called at the Wai Chiao Pu and the Japanese Chargé
                    d’Affaires and the British Minister, one after the other, verbally communicated
                    the advice of their respective Governments. Your excellency, acting upon the
                    instructions of the Russian Government, associated yourself with it. I have duly
                    taken note of this. I reply to your excellency in the same sense in which I have
                    replied to the Japanese Chargé d’Affaires and the British Minister. The replies
                    are as follows: (Here follow the replies to the Japanese Chargé d’Affaires and
                    the British Minister.)</p>
                <p>I request your excellency to convey the above to the Russian Government.</p>
            </div>
